<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Copiar Chave PIX</title>

<style>
    *{
        margin:0;
        padding:0;
        box-sizing:border-box;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    body{
        background:#f4f7fa;
        display:flex;
        justify-content:center;
        align-items:center;
        height:100vh;
    }

    .container{
        background:white;
        padding:40px;
        border-radius:20px;
        box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
        text-align:center;
        max-width:450px;
        width:90%;
    }

    .pix-logo{
        width:90px;
        margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    h1{
        color:#32BCAD;
        margin-bottom:15px;
    }

    p{
        color:#555;
        margin-bottom:20px;
    }

    .pix-key{
        background:#f1f5f9;
        border:1px solid #dbe3ea;
        border-radius:10px;
        padding:15px;
        font-size:18px;
        font-weight:bold;
        margin-bottom:25px;
        word-break:break-all;
    }

    button{
        background:#32BCAD;
        color:white;
        border:none;
        padding:15px 30px;
        border-radius:10px;
        font-size:16px;
        cursor:pointer;
        transition:.3s;
    }

    button:hover{
        background:#28a396;
    }

    #mensagem{
        margin-top:15px;
        color:#28a396;
        font-weight:bold;
        display:none;
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <!-- Logo PIX SVG -->
    <svg class="pix-logo" viewBox="0 0 256 256" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path fill="#32BCAD" d="M76.8 61.8c8.5-8.5 19.7-13.2 31.8-13.2h38.8c12 0 23.2 4.7 31.8 13.2l21.1 21.1c2.5 2.5 2.5 6.5 0 9l-24.4 24.4c-3.9 3.9-10.3 3.9-14.2 0l-28.3-28.3c-3.1-3.1-8.1-3.1-11.2 0l-28.3 28.3c-3.9 3.9-10.3 3.9-14.2 0L55.8 91.9c-2.5-2.5-2.5-6.5 0-9l21-21.1Zm102.4 132.4c-8.5 8.5-19.7 13.2-31.8 13.2h-38.8c-12 0-23.2-4.7-31.8-13.2l-21.1-21.1c-2.5-2.5-2.5-6.5 0-9l24.4-24.4c3.9-3.9 10.3-3.9 14.2 0l28.3 28.3c3.1 3.1 8.1 3.1 11.2 0l28.3-28.3c3.9-3.9 10.3-3.9 14.2 0l24.4 24.4c2.5 2.5 2.5 6.5 0 9l-21.1 21.1Z"/>
    </svg>

    <h1>Pagamento via PIX</h1>

    <p>Clique no botão abaixo para copiar a chave PIX:</p>

    <div class="pix-key" id="pixKey">
        64.528.932/0001-94
    </div>

    <button onclick="copiarPix()">
        📋 Copiar Chave PIX
    </button>

    <div id="mensagem">
        ✅ Chave PIX copiada com sucesso!
    </div>

</div>

<script>
function copiarPix(){
    navigator.clipboard.writeText("64.528.932/0001-94");

    document.getElementById("mensagem").style.display="block";

    setTimeout(()=>{
        document.getElementById("mensagem").style.display="none";
    },3000);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
